msgid "Pending removal in Python 3.17"
msgstr "Planerad borttagning i Python 3.17"

msgid ":mod:`collections.abc`:"
msgstr ":mod:`collections.abc`:"

msgid ""
":class:`collections.abc.ByteString` is scheduled for removal in Python 3.17."
msgstr ""
":class:`collections.abc.ByteString` är planerad att tas bort i Python 3.17."

msgid ""
"Use ``isinstance(obj, collections.abc.Buffer)`` to test if ``obj`` "
"implements the :ref:`buffer protocol <bufferobjects>` at runtime. For use in"
" type annotations, either use :class:`~collections.abc.Buffer` or a union "
"that explicitly specifies the types your code supports (e.g., ``bytes | "
"bytearray | memoryview``)."
msgstr ""
"Använd ``isinstance(obj, collections.abc.Buffer)`` för att vid körning testa"
" om ``obj`` implementerar :ref:`buffertprotokollet <bufferobjects>`. Använd "
"antingen :class:`~collections.abc.Buffer` eller en union som uttryckligen "
"anger vilka typer koden stöder, till exempel ``bytes | bytearray | "
"memoryview``, i typannoteringar."

msgid ""
":class:`!ByteString` was originally intended to be an abstract class that "
"would serve as a supertype of both :class:`bytes` and :class:`bytearray`. "
"However, since the ABC never had any methods, knowing that an object was an "
"instance of :class:`!ByteString` never actually told you anything useful "
"about the object. Other common buffer types such as :class:`memoryview` were"
" also never understood as subtypes of :class:`!ByteString` (either at "
"runtime or by static type checkers)."
msgstr ""
":class:`!ByteString` var ursprungligen avsedd att vara en abstrakt klass som"
" skulle fungera som supertyp för både :class:`bytes` och :class:`bytearray`."
" Eftersom ABC:n aldrig hade några metoder gav det aldrig någon användbar "
"information om objektet att veta att det var en instans av "
":class:`!ByteString`. Andra vanliga bufferttyper, såsom :class:`memoryview`,"
" kändes aldrig heller igen som undertyper av :class:`!ByteString`, varken "
"vid körning eller av statiska typkontroller."

msgid ""
"See :pep:`PEP 688 <688#current-options>` for more details. (Contributed by "
"Shantanu Jain in :gh:`91896`.)"
msgstr ""
"Se :pep:`PEP 688 <688#current-options>` för mer information. (Bidrag av "
"Shantanu Jain i :gh:`91896`.)"

msgid ":mod:`typing`:"
msgstr ":mod:`typing`:"

msgid ""
"Before Python 3.14, old-style unions were implemented using the private "
"class ``typing._UnionGenericAlias``. This class is no longer needed for the "
"implementation, but it has been retained for backward compatibility, with "
"removal scheduled for Python 3.17. Users should use documented introspection"
" helpers like :func:`typing.get_origin` and :func:`typing.get_args` instead "
"of relying on private implementation details."
msgstr ""
"Före Python 3.14 implementerades unioner av gammal stil med den privata "
"klassen ``typing._UnionGenericAlias``. Klassen behövs inte längre för "
"implementeringen, men har behållits för bakåtkompatibilitet och är planerad "
"att tas bort i Python 3.17. Användarna bör använda dokumenterade "
"introspektionshjälpfunktioner, såsom :func:`typing.get_origin` och "
":func:`typing.get_args`, i stället för att förlita sig på privata "
"implementeringsdetaljer."

msgid ""
":class:`typing.ByteString`, deprecated since Python 3.9, is scheduled for "
"removal in Python 3.17."
msgstr ""
":class:`typing.ByteString`, som varit föråldrad sedan Python 3.9, är "
"planerad att tas bort i Python 3.17."
